                                                "sense_id": "720c3ea1-27ba-3759-897b-d5be48d506a1",
                                                "text": "TransPennine Express has removed all QR codes from its 71 car parks after scammers covered up a genuine code sticker with a false one and stole £13,000 from a woman's bank account."
                                            }
